==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|stabilise}} (UK)

===Verb===
{{en-verb|stabiliz}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To make [[stable]].
#: ''Jody '''stabilized''' the table by putting a book under the short leg.''
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To become [[stable]].
#: ''The country will '''stabilize''' after the next election ends.''

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|stabilizer}}
* {{l|en|stabilization}}

